 CBStart args
⍝ The first click creates the overlay object - which is what makes EWC fetch
⍝ and inject the plugin's JavaScript - and later clicks just restart it.
⍝ Running defaults to 1, so creating the object is enough to start the show.
 :If 9=⎕NC'F1.FW'
     'F1.FW'eWS'Running' 1
 :Else
     'F1.FW'eWC'Fireworks'
 :EndIf
